# synthetic -- NOT a capture. No classic vLLM answered during pass 5 (http://192.0.2.2:8000 and
# http://192.0.2.12:8000 refused on 2026-09-15 at 21:17Z). Built from the exposed family names,
# types and labels cited in worklog/vllm-gateway-throughput.md Q2 (vLLM v0.23.0
# vllm/v1/metrics/loggers.py; prometheus_client exposition: a counter gains `_total`, a histogram
# exposes `_bucket`/`_count`/`_sum`, `_created` gauges follow). Label order copies the captured
# box-a lines in lb/tests/test_engine_stats.py. Shape: a FRESH sidecar (every lease start is one),
# idle, every counter at 0. Follow-up for the coordinator: replace with a live GET of
# http://192.0.2.2:8000/metrics taken while idle.
